;; Attempted minimal illustration of a case where the same Undep rewrite
;; (IterE of a literal option/list with no bound variable -> forced OptE/ListE)
;; is arguably safe: a def clause whose own pattern already fully determines
;; the optional field's presence, so there is no sibling derivation being
;; discarded by forcing it.

syntax tag = SMALL | BIG

syntax marker = X

def $extra(tag) : marker?
def $extra(SMALL) = eps
def $extra(BIG) = X
